<title>JAPAN: Koei -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Koei -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.43		vs	    4.05</p>
<p> Operating	    1.05		vs	  924    million</p>
<p> Current		1.18		vs	    1.06</p>
<p> Net		  657    million	  vs	  652    million</p>
<p> EPS		   29.84 yen	  vs	   29.59 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     22 million	  vs	  22 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 15.00 yen	  vs	   15.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Koei Co Ltd is a PC and home-use game software developer.</p>
